input.body:
Owner decision (2026-09-13, after #1986): the per-session rule-token figure the usage fold parses off the session-start summary sentence, and everything the dashboard builds on it, are an overreach. Remove them entirely:

- the fold's `ruleTokensIn` / `ruleTokensByPackIn` parsers and the `ruleTokens`, `ruleTokenSessions`, `ruleTokensByPack` keys it writes;
- the dashboard's rule-token series, the "heaviest rule source" sub-line and the fleet mean of rule tokens per session;
- the docs describing them.

The session-start summary line itself stays as #1986 left it.

